Ruled out:
- ConversionError: Yes, the traceback shows that a `ConversionError` is raised from `axis.py` as a wrapper around the `MatplotlibDeprecationWarning` when warnings are configured to be errors. The instantiation of this class is therefore a direct part of the observed symptom.
